    "Name": "Rotunda C Spycar",
    "Details": "This variant replaces the original Rotunda's fusion engine with a Clan extra-light model and its armament with four Clan ER Small Lasers, and adds a Clan Watchdog Suite to make it a better scout. The weight saved went into much thicker Clan Ferro-Fibrous armor while the vehicle still became lighter, which solved the old technical issues and freed room for the one-person crew. Where the original Rotunda was a glass cannon that could not survive return fire, this version has working armor and only close range weapons, so it serves Society agents and intervention teams as a surprise knife-fighter.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       100      5\n<b>Left</b>          80      5\n<b>Right</b>        80      5\n<b>Rear</b>         75      5\n\n<b>Total</b>      335     20</color>",
    "Icon": "Rotunda"
  },
